{%- comment -%}
  Home DZ 2026 — hero cinematografico, marchi, categorie, ultimi arrivi (dalla
  collezione new-arrivals), usato reale, permuta (solo verso il nuovo), rate.
  Tutto legge dalle collezioni esistenti: nessun dato inventato.
{%- endcomment -%}

<section class="hero">
  <div class="backdrop" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <svg class="bike" viewBox="0 0 920 620" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="hgFrame" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="0"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#FF7A00"/><stop offset=".55" stop-color="#FF2E63"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#8B2FE6"/></linearGradient>
      <radialGradient id="hgShadow"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#000" stop-opacity=".5"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#000" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient>
    </defs>
    <ellipse cx="240" cy="588" rx="185" ry="17" fill="url(#hgShadow)"/>
    <ellipse cx="680" cy="588" rx="185" ry="17" fill="url(#hgShadow)"/>
    <g stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.13)" stroke-width="1.5">
      <path d="M106 430H374M240 296V564M145.3 335.3 334.7 524.7M145.3 524.7 334.7 335.3"/>
      <path d="M546 430H814M680 296V564M585.3 335.3 774.7 524.7M585.3 524.7 774.7 335.3"/>
    </g>
    <circle cx="240" cy="430" r="148" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.3)" stroke-width="9"/>
    <circle cx="240" cy="430" r="134" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.55)" stroke-width="2.5"/>
    <circle cx="680" cy="430" r="148" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.3)" stroke-width="9"/>
    <circle cx="680" cy="430" r="134" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.55)" stroke-width="2.5"/>
    <path d="M432 402 240 412M432 490 240 448" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.22)" stroke-width="3"/>
    <circle cx="240" cy="430" r="18" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.4)" stroke-width="3"/>
    <path d="M372 270 636 258 654 306M432 446 372 270M432 446 654 306M432 446 240 430 372 270" stroke="url(#hgFrame)" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
    <path d="M654 306C664 350 674 392 680 430" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.8)" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    <circle cx="432" cy="446" r="44" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.5)" stroke-width="3"/>
    <circle cx="432" cy="446" r="10" fill="rgba(255,255,255,.8)"/>
    <path d="M432 446 468 506M450 506H492" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.85)" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    <path d="M372 270 356 208" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.85)" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    <path d="M316 202C340 196 372 196 396 202" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.9)" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    <path d="M636 258 668 242" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.85)" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    <path d="M668 242c34 -2 50 12 48 34c-2 24 -22 34 -40 30" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,.9)" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    <circle cx="240" cy="430" r="8" fill="rgba(255,255,255,.85)"/>
    <circle cx="680" cy="430" r="8" fill="rgba(255,255,255,.85)"/>
  </svg>
  {%- comment -%}
    La Foil vera, sfumata nella scena scura: pozza di luce dietro, fusione
    multiply per far sparire il fondo bianco, maschera radiale sui bordi.
    Se la foto non carica, torna la bici disegnata.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="hero-foil" aria-hidden="true">
    <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0873/6885/9912/files/4253408086.png?v=1783042506&width=1200" alt="" loading="eager"
         onerror="var b=document.querySelector('.hero .bike');if(b)b.style.display='block';this.closest('.hero-foil').remove()">
  </div>
  <div class="veil" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="wrap hwrap">
    <p class="kicker" style="margin:0 0 18px">Nuova collezione {{ 'now' | date: '%Y' }}</p>
    <h1>La tua prossima bici<br><span class="g">inizia qui.</span></h1>
    <p class="lede">Bici da corsa, gravel, mountain bike ed e-bike delle migliori marche. Consegna in tutta Italia, assistenza in officina e la consulenza di chi pedala davvero.</p>
    <div class="cta">
      <a class="btn" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">Scopri il catalogo</a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="#bike-finder">Trova la tua bici</a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="/collections/new-arrivals">Ultimi arrivi →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="heroStats">
      <div><b>{{ collections['new-arrivals'].products_count | default: '350+' }}</b><span>MODELLI A CATALOGO</span></div>
      <div><b>4 brand</b><span>RIVENDITORI UFFICIALI</span></div>
      <div><b>Officina</b><span>ASSISTENZA CERTIFICATA</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap fullw" style="padding-top:34px"><div class="logowall">
  <span class="lw-label">Rivenditori ufficiali</span>
  <div class="lw-row">
    <a class="lw-cell" href="/pages/trek"><img src="{{ 'trek.png' | file_url }}" alt="Trek" loading="lazy"></a>
    <a class="lw-cell" href="/pages/scott"><img src="{{ 'scott.png' | file_url }}" alt="Scott" loading="lazy"></a>
    <a class="lw-cell" href="/pages/cannondale"><img src="{{ 'cnd.png' | file_url }}" alt="Cannondale" loading="lazy"></a>
    <a class="lw-cell" href="/pages/amflow"><img src="{{ 'amflow.png' | file_url }}" alt="Amflow" loading="lazy"></a>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="block wrap">
  <div class="head"><div><p class="k">Il catalogo</p><h2>Scegli la tua disciplina</h2></div><a class="more" href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">Tutte le bici</a></div>
  <div class="cats">
    {%- assign bento = 'usato-1,bici-da-strada,ebikes,gravel,mountain-bike,urban' | split: ',' -%}
    {%- for handle in bento -%}
      {%- assign c = collections[handle] -%}
      {%- if c != blank -%}
        <a class="cat {% if forloop.first %}hero2{% elsif forloop.index == 2 or forloop.index == 3 %}wide{% endif %}" href="{{ c.url }}">
          {%- if c.featured_image -%}<img class="bg" src="{{ c.featured_image | image_url: width: 900 }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{%- endif -%}
          <div class="vg"></div>
          {%- if forloop.first -%}<span class="flag"><i></i>Pezzi unici</span>{%- endif -%}
          <div class="lb">
            <span class="c">{{ c.products_count }} modelli</span>
            <h3>{{ c.title }}</h3>
            {%- if forloop.first -%}<p>Bici selezionate e controllate nella nostra officina, pronte a partire. Ogni annuncio ha la sua data di pubblicazione.</p>{%- endif -%}
          </div>
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="block wrap fullw">
  <div class="head"><div><p class="k">Ultimi arrivi</p><h2>Le ultime bici caricate</h2></div><a class="more" href="/collections/new-arrivals">Vedi tutte</a></div>
  <div class="prods">
    {%- assign mostrate = 0 -%}
    {%- for p in collections['new-arrivals'].products limit: 24 -%}
      {%- if mostrate < 8 and p.featured_image and p.type != 'USATO' -%}
        {% render 'dz-card', product: p %}
        {%- assign mostrate = mostrate | plus: 1 -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="block wrap" id="bike-finder" style="padding-top:20px;padding-bottom:20px">
  {%- comment -%}
    Copertina ridisegnata: niente foto (cover trasparente), veste identica
    alla scheda finanziamento, card in vetro aggiunta a destra.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="dz-finder">
    {% render 'bike-finder-app', whatsapp: '393457815102' %}
    <div class="dz-findercard" aria-hidden="true">
      <span class="fc-k">Come funziona</span>
      <div class="fc-row"><span>Domande</span><b>3</b></div>
      <div class="fc-row"><span>Tempo</span><b>1 minuto</b></div>
      <div class="fc-big"><b>3 bici</b><span>su misura</span></div>
      <div class="fc-bar"><i></i></div>
      <div class="fc-legend"><span>Catalogo reale</span><span>Nella tua taglia</span></div>
      <p class="fc-note">Ti proponiamo solo modelli davvero disponibili, nella tua taglia, presi dal catalogo del negozio.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="block wrap fullw">
  <div class="head"><div><p class="k">Occasioni</p><h2>Usato garantito</h2></div><a class="more" href="/collections/usato-1">Tutto l'usato</a></div>
  <div class="prods">
    {%- for p in collections['usato-1'].products limit: 4 -%}
      {% render 'dz-card', product: p %}
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap" style="padding-top:6px"><div class="dzs-svcrow">
  <a class="dzs-svc" href="/pages/service"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a4 4 0 00-5.4 5.4L4 17v3h3l5.3-5.3a4 4 0 005.4-5.4L15 12l-3-3z"/></svg></span><span class="tx"><b>Service & Officina</b><span>Assistenza</span></span></a>
  <a class="dzs-svc" href="/pages/permuta-il-tuo-usato"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 8h13l-3-3M20 16H7l3 3"/></svg></span><span class="tx"><b>Permuta il tuo usato</b><span>Valutazione gratuita</span></span></a>
  <a class="dzs-svc" href="/pages/finanziamenti-agevolati"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 7h16v10H4z"/><path d="M4 10h16"/></svg></span><span class="tx"><b>Finanziamenti agevolati</b><span>Pagamenti su misura</span></span></a>
  <a class="dzs-svc" href="/pages/contact"><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><circle cx="6.5" cy="16.5" r="3.4"/><circle cx="17.5" cy="16.5" r="3.4"/><path d="M6.5 16.5l5-8h4l2 8M11.5 8.5l-1.5-3h3.5"/></svg></span><span class="tx"><b>Test ride & consulenza</b><span>Prova prima di scegliere</span></span></a>
</div></section>

{% section 'dz-permuta' %}

<section class="block wrap"><div class="fin">
  <div class="fin-l">
    <p class="k">Finanziamento agevolato</p>
    <h2>La bici subito. Il pagamento, con calma.</h2>
    <p>Da <b>6 a 60 rate</b> con <b>TAN fisso</b> e risposta in pochi minuti. Simuli la rata direttamente sulla scheda di ogni bici. Anche sull'usato.</p>
    <a class="btn" style="background:#fff;color:var(--ink)" href="/pages/finanziamenti-agevolati">Scopri i finanziamenti</a>
  </div>
  <div class="fin-r"><div class="fin-card">
    <span class="fc-k">Esempio di rata</span>
    <div class="fc-row"><span>Importo</span><b>€ 4.199</b></div>
    <div class="fc-row"><span>Durata</span><b>48 mesi</b></div>
    <div class="fc-big"><b>€ 100</b><span>/mese</span></div>
    <div class="fc-bar"><i></i></div>
    <div class="fc-legend"><span>6 mesi</span><span>60 mesi</span></div>
    <p class="fc-note">Esempio con ammortamento alla francese. Il TAEG dipende da spese di istruttoria e imposte ed è indicato nel contratto. Salvo approvazione della finanziaria.</p>
  </div></div>
</div></section>

<section class="block wrap" style="padding-bottom:30px"><div class="news">
  <h2>Resta aggiornato</h2>
  <p>Nuovi arrivi, usato fresco e offerte riservate. Niente spam, promesso.</p>
  {%- form 'customer', class: 'nform' -%}
    <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="newsletter">
    {%- if form.posted_successfully? -%}
      <p style="color:var(--ok);font-weight:600;width:100%">Iscrizione registrata: benvenuto!</p>
    {%- else -%}
      <input type="email" name="contact[email]" placeholder="La tua email" aria-label="La tua email" required>
      <button class="btn" type="submit">Iscriviti</button>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endform -%}
</div></section>
